    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ecd2ddbc2180b55f46fa967",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，抱歉声音太大了……！那个，怎么说呢……\n虽然姑且算是自信之作……怎、怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0ae37a773bc7d2e0e588a3af6bbe287296a54b214663872e692e935180d843",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
