    {
      "uid": "zhcn:331397c2f487997b320e0648",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏合宿中的某一天。操作着平板电脑，关闭了神业发来的原稿。\n对于这部题为『I'm Last One』的作品的感想是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c746bccf6faacb93106a935b1576d443dc8a9429651f31587a39445d2bc3d21c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
