    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8e6135bb27d3d5e47dbea80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是一部完成了王道惊悚恐怖片该做之事的佳作。\n沉迷于丧尸的描写力和角色的魅力，而且最重要的是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3abaa53bf80ef716d84a78c38da83269f28e16f3066f3cdb2bc1dd65367ef91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084a07209d77acc6d18ec792",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "告诉了她，正是因为那个场景之前一直持续着『紧迫的场面』，\n所以看到角色之间那愉快的互动，让人不由得露出了笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2d2a34ab6868c38e2ceb2b656af25749be9939cab2c2a97d3be11a445145a2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
